# Original bundled textbook archives — large, and not part of the PWA. Anchored to the repo
# root (leading slash) so they don't also match data/hsk1/, data/hsk2/, etc. — those are real
# app data and must stay tracked; without the anchor, git's case-insensitive matching on Windows
# silently ignored them too.
